## 3. Layout

### 3.1 Auto Layout Hygiene

❌ Bad: `v.frame = CGRect(x: 16, y: 100, width: 343, height: 44)` (magic numbers, device-specific)
✅ Good: `v.translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints = false; NSLayoutConstraint.activate([...])` against `safeAreaLayoutGuide` / `layoutMarginsGuide`
⚠️ Why: Breaks on other sizes, Dynamic Type, rotation, resizing
🔧 Fix: Constraints or `UIStackView`; activate in batches; no fixed heights for text containers

**Detect:** Hardcoded frame literals, missing `translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints = false`, `isActive = true` per constraint in loops, fixed height on cells with labels, "Unable to simultaneously satisfy constraints" ignored

### 3.2 Keyboard Avoidance

❌ Bad: Observe `keyboardWillShowNotification` and adjust `bottomConstraint.constant` manually
✅ Good: `field.bottomAnchor.constraint(equalTo: view.keyboardLayoutGuide.topAnchor)`
⚠️ Why: Manual math misses floating/split keyboards and animation curves
🔧 Fix: Constrain to `keyboardLayoutGuide` (iOS 15+)

**Detect:** `UIResponder.keyboardWillShowNotification` observers, `keyboardFrameEndUserInfoKey` math

### 3.3 Adapt to Size, Not Device or Orientation

❌ Bad: `if UIDevice.current.userInterfaceIdiom == .pad || isLandscape { twoColumns() }`
✅ Good: `if traitCollection.horizontalSizeClass == .regular { twoColumns() }` re-run via automatic trait tracking or `registerForTraitChanges`
⚠️ Why: iPad windows, Stage Manager, and resizable iPhone apps (iOS 27) produce any size on any device
🔧 Fix: Branch on size class or available width; set initial state in `viewIsAppearing(_:)`; declare orientations in `UIWindowSceneDelegate.supportedInterfaceOrientations(for:)` on iOS 27 SDK

**Detect:** `userInterfaceIdiom` for layout, `interfaceOrientation` checks, `traitCollectionDidChange` overrides, layout in `viewWillAppear` that reads traits

