## 6. Appearance and Accessibility

### 6.1 Button Configurations and Semantic Styling

❌ Bad: `button.backgroundColor = .blue; button.layer.cornerRadius = 8; button.setTitleColor(.white, for: .normal)`
✅ Good: `button.configuration = .filled()` (or `.glass()` / `.prominentGlass()` on iOS 26+)
⚠️ Why: Manual styling ignores states, Dynamic Type, accessibility contrast, Liquid Glass
🔧 Fix: `UIButton.Configuration` + `configurationUpdateHandler`; semantic colors (`.label`, `.systemBackground`, `.tintColor`); no hardcoded hex for text/background

**Detect:** `setTitleColor`, `layer.cornerRadius` on buttons, `UIColor(red:green:blue:)` for text/backgrounds, `contentEdgeInsets` (deprecated)

### 6.2 Do Not Fight System Bars (Liquid Glass)

❌ Bad: `appearance.configureWithOpaqueBackground(); appearance.backgroundColor = .white` applied to every navigation bar
✅ Good: Standard `UINavigationController`/`UITabBarController`/toolbars; customize via `UINavigationItem` and bar button items
⚠️ Why: Opaque overrides remove Liquid Glass and scroll edge effects; looks dated on iOS 26+
🔧 Fix: Remove global appearance overrides unless design requires; `UIGlassEffect` only for custom floating controls; no glass on glass
📍 See: `ios-ui-development-focus.mdc` Liquid Glass

**Detect:** Global `UINavigationBar.appearance()` background overrides, custom tab bar views replacing `UITabBarController`, `UIVisualEffectView` blur stacked inside bars

### 6.3 Dynamic Type and Labels

❌ Bad: `label.font = .systemFont(ofSize: 17)`; image-only button without label
✅ Good: `label.font = .preferredFont(forTextStyle: .body); label.adjustsFontForContentSizeCategory = true`; `button.accessibilityLabel = "Delete"`
⚠️ Why: Text ignores user size; VoiceOver reads "button"
🔧 Fix: Text styles or `UIFontMetrics.scaledFont(for:)`; `numberOfLines = 0`; test at accessibility sizes

**Detect:** `systemFont(ofSize:` for body text, missing `adjustsFontForContentSizeCategory`, `UIImage(systemName:)` buttons without `accessibilityLabel`, `numberOfLines = 1` on variable text

