## 7. Deprecated API Replacements

|Avoid|Use|
|---|---|
|`UIWebView`|`WKWebView`|
|`UIAlertView`, `UIActionSheet`|`UIAlertController`|
|`UIGraphicsBeginImageContext`|`UIGraphicsImageRenderer`|
|`traitCollectionDidChange(_:)`|Automatic trait tracking or `registerForTraitChanges`|
|`UIScreen.main`, `keyWindow`, `windows`|Scene/view/trait context (§1.2)|
|`UIScreen` display link|`UIWindowScene` display link (iOS 27 SDK)|
|`application(_:supportedInterfaceOrientationsFor:)`|`UIWindowSceneDelegate.supportedInterfaceOrientations(for:)`|
|`UIAccelerometer`|Core Motion|
|Cell `textLabel` / `imageView`|Content configurations (§4.2)|

**iOS 27 SDK behavior changes:** menu images hidden by default on iPadOS/macOS (set `preferredImageVisibility`); drag delegate may run without a user drag (move UI from `sessionWillBegin` to `sessionDidMove`); traits propagate through presentation hierarchy (check custom `UIPresentationController`).

